The '''Handy Blood Chalice''' is a {{Common}} [[Accessory]]. It increases {{Stat|ferocity}} at a {{Stat|soulflow}} cost.

== Obtaining ==
A '''Handy Blood Chalice''' has a {{Odds|Pray RNGesus|no=yes}} chance to drop from [[Voidgloom Seraph]] {{SlayerTier|IV}} if the player has {{Coll|Enderman Slayer LVL 5}}. It has a {{Green|0.18%}} ({{Green|1/566.76}}) chance to drop.

== Usage ==
'''Handy Blood Chalice''' requires {{Coll|Enderman Slayer LVL 5}} to use. 

Its ability can be toggled on and off by holding and right clicking it.

When in combat with it enabled and with sufficient {{Stat|Soulflow}}, it increases its user's {{stat|ferocity}} by {{Green|20}} and takes away {{Stat|Soulflow|1}} per 5 seconds.

=== Salvaging ===
'''Handy Blood Chalice''' can be salvaged for {{Item|Dragon Essence|amount=15}}.

== Trivia ==
*It used to have the same texture as {{Item|Cup of Blood}}.

